  "verification": "paper-verified (corrected via workflow)",
  "verification_evidence": "The growth medium was composed of 0.2 mM MgCl2·H2O, 0.2 mM CaCl2·H2O, 1 mM Na2SO4, 2 mM K2SO4, 2 mM (NH4)2SO4, and 50 µM NaH2PO4·H2O. The final trace element concentration was 1 µM NiCl2·6H2O, CoCl2·6H2O, NaMoO4·2H2O, and ZnSO4·7H2O, 5 µM MnCl2·4H2O and FeSO4·7H2O, 10 µM CuSO4·5H2O, and 20 nM CeCl3·6H2O ... The pH was ... controlled at 3.0 ... The reactor was supplied with 70 mL min−1 CO2–Ar, 10 m",
  "verification_confidence": "high",
